sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Console
  participant GW as gateway
  participant SG as Sentinel Guard
  participant AG as agent (any replica)
  participant MR as mcp-remediation
  participant S as service ops API
  participant MO as mcp-observability
  participant DB as Postgres
  Note over AG,SG: earlier, when the proposal was ready: the agent registered it<br/>POST /v1/actions {action, target: tenant/service, change: {incident, size?}} → ar-…-1 (Pending)
  U->>GW: POST /incidents/{id}/decision {approved}
  GW->>AG: GET view (proposed action, approval.request)
  alt a guard request exists (action ≠ escalate)
    GW->>SG: POST /v1/actions/ar-…-1/approve|deny {approver = JWT subject} · gateway's own token (delegate)
    SG-->>GW: Approved by alice@acme via the gateway (or 409: expired / already decided → nothing resumes)
  end
  GW->>AG: decision (reviewer = JWT subject), no credential to execute travels here
  AG->>DB: load checkpoint thread tenant:incident
  alt status is not AWAITING_APPROVAL
    AG-->>GW: 409 (decisions are single-use)
  else approved, executable
    AG->>SG: GET /v1/actions/ar-…-1 (agent's own token)
    SG-->>AG: single-use capability (ES256, aud sentinel-action, action, target, change, approver), issued once
    AG->>MR: tools/call <action>(target, params) · Bearer capability
    MR->>MR: verify with the guard's JWKS: signature, aud, expiry, action, target, every parameter
    MR->>SG: POST /v1/capabilities/spend (guard down → refuse)
    SG-->>MR: 200 consumed (a second spend → 409)
    MR->>S: POST /ops/<action>
    S-->>MR: result
    MR-->>AG: executed + guard request + audit log line
    loop up to 6 probes, 5 s apart
      AG->>MO: probe_service(target)
      MO-->>AG: success rate, p95
    end
    AG->>DB: checkpoint RESOLVED or REMEDIATION_FAILED + timeline + postmortem
    AG-->>GW: view
  else rejected / escalate
    AG-->>GW: CLOSED_NO_ACTION / ESCALATED + postmortem
  end
  GW->>DB: UPDATE incident (status, timeline, TTM) · INSERT remediation_audit (guard request, capability jti)
  GW-->>U: view
